Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.44,0:00:08.15,Animal,,0,0,0,,A forest tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.95,0:00:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I'm not wrong, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.99,0:00:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,a flower fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But not from this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.28,0:00:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where could she come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.97,0:00:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.45,0:00:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.44,0:00:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Not me...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.53,0:00:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I let you run now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth did she want here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.66,0:00:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Bidiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.61,0:00:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Bidiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.14,0:00:59.60,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(350,570)}{\fad(1600,0)}Flower fairy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.74,0:01:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't devour everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.39,0:01:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You can eat only wood, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.75,0:01:08.94,Animal,,0,0,0,,She says you can't eat everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.70,0:01:10.47,Animal,,0,0,0,,Only wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.94,0:01:11.44,Animal,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.34,0:01:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The news of the Sky Pearl have already spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.06,0:01:15.73,Animal,,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.20,0:01:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already on the website.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:18.52,Animal,,0,0,0,,Website?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.16,0:01:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.98,0:01:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only used by spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.46,0:01:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans can't reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.57,0:01:24.33,Animal,,0,0,0,,Such a thing exists?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.78,0:01:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Many spirits live in the human world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.78,0:01:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a few are on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.72,0:01:30.17,Animal,,0,0,0,,Not exactly what I was thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.57,0:01:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The human world affects spirits quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.41,0:01:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a member-only board.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.92,0:01:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It has about 3000 members,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.55,0:01:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's quite lively.
