Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.76,0:01:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's here that the Sky Pearl quest was accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.18,0:01:42.00,Animal,,0,0,0,,I can't read well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.69,0:01:47.73,ImageBoard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(239,284)}{\fs60\frx20\fry-10\frz-1.5}Laojun
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.69,0:01:47.73,ImageBoard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(680,400)}{\frx8\fry0\frz0}holy crap, someone did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.69,0:01:47.73,ImageBoard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(790,522)}{\frx8\fry0\frz0}I didn't think it could actually be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.69,0:01:47.73,ImageBoard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(728,640)}{\frx8\fry0\frz0}You're still using that profile pic...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.69,0:01:47.73,ImageBoard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(480,760)}{\frx10\fry0\frz0}laojun!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.69,0:01:47.73,ImageBoard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(740,900)}{\frx8\fry0\frz0}respect to the god who pulled it off.
