Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.60,0:01:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This was posted by Master Lao.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.09,0:01:45.73,Animal,,0,0,0,,Does he have to post it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.01,0:01:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's the rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.81,0:01:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Vow quests are well-known in the spirit community.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.09,0:01:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There are even manuals for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.78,0:01:52.37,Animal,,0,0,0,,Manuals?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, because the originals are complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.82,0:01:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Look. They were published after\NMaster Lao stopped making vows.
