Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.59,0:02:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 12 books of vows without the manuals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.92,0:02:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Together the Collection of Twelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.66,0:02:04.46,Animal,,0,0,0,,So many of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.82,0:02:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Many people follow these posts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You see my point?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.73,0:02:09.49,Animal,,0,0,0,,You mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.49,0:02:10.30,Animal,,0,0,0,,someone can take the prize away?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.77,0:02:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.74,0:02:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's easier than to go to Master Lao's.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this the fairy from yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.84,0:02:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.58,0:02:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never know! Kill me if you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.78,0:02:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.74,0:02:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Spare me, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.36,0:02:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a cure for my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.17,0:02:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I could feel strong spiritual energy in this direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.09,0:02:46.88,Animal,,0,0,0,,Fairy sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.12,0:02:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite a rare skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.66,0:02:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.96,0:02:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Fenmo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.24,0:02:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a lovely little flower fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.20,0:02:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't harm people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.14,0:02:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.26,0:02:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We are spirits too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.98,0:03:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.77,0:03:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm human.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.75,0:03:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.36,0:03:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a lovely little flower fairy...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.34,0:03:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gravely ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.40,0:03:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fast asleep and won't wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.11,0:03:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is why you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.24,0:03:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.99,0:03:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But the thing you felt can't cure your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.24,0:03:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you take me to your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.93,0:03:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.37,0:03:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.23,0:03:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Lingfeng Mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.86,0:03:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a long way from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.72,0:03:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder I've never met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.73,0:03:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you found anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.62,0:03:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Some de-souling grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.16,0:03:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think it'll help in this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.04,0:03:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We can start heading over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.34,0:03:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,A fairy dragon...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.14,0:03:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So there are fairies that big around here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.42,0:03:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't take us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.78,0:03:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You should wait for us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.10,0:03:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.57,0:04:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I put Bidiu in his cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.28,0:04:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.50,0:04:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bidiu will be a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.62,0:04:05.63,Animal,,0,0,0,,Be good, no roughhousing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.45,0:04:08.25,Animal,,0,0,0,,No need to say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.69,0:04:10.65,Animal,,0,0,0,,Heixiu will keep an eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.13,0:04:11.71,Animal,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.29,0:04:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for helping us out, Xiaolong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.11,0:04:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Unconscious for a month?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.65,0:04:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he a flower fairy too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.09,0:04:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he's a tree fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.12,0:04:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How can a fairy be in a coma for such a long time?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.33,0:04:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.13,0:04:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! This is the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.44,0:04:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiguo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.36,0:04:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.89,0:04:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaolong, you can go back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.24,0:04:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call you when we're done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's lively here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.74,0:04:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Gen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.72,0:04:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.49,0:04:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring him outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.07,0:05:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.45,0:05:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.62,0:05:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.97,0:05:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiguo! You got better!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.40,0:05:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There are two souls in his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.17,0:05:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,One of them is very weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.06,0:05:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and the other one doesn't belong in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.05,0:05:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.36,0:05:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Most likely,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.13,0:05:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,that's not your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.52,0:05:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.64,0:05:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Qiguo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.04,0:05:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know for sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.18,0:05:51.77,Animal,,0,0,0,,Spirit trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.05,0:05:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.25,0:05:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.88,0:05:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A giantifying trap?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.70,0:06:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.42,0:06:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why run away, after we fell in his trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.76,0:06:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.67,0:06:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.00,0:07:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys shrunk...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.51,0:07:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fault...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.95,0:07:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.06,0:07:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't cautious enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.78,0:07:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he set up such a strong trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.35,0:07:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did I get shrunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.31,0:07:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a fairy body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.86,0:07:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,These traps only affect material sprites.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.65,0:07:30.08,Title 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1600,0)\pos(1349,520)}Lingfeng Mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.39,0:07:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How will you turn back?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.15,0:07:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It will wear off after some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.06,0:07:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't know exactly when.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.29,0:07:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And Qiguo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.74,0:07:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What if he's already...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.23,0:07:35.16,Animal,,0,0,0,,The two souls depend on each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.16,0:07:35.69,Animal,,0,0,0,,Qiguo must be still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.89,0:07:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.68,0:07:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But we need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.96,0:07:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We must find him quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.63,0:07:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But he seemed to be so strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.14,0:07:44.01,Animal,,0,0,0,,This trap wasn't set up just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been prepared beforehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone could do this in a second,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.59,0:07:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,it would be terrible...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.67,0:07:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't attack when the trap got us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.75,0:07:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if he has bad intentions,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.28,0:07:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,he is still very weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.14,0:07:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.95,0:07:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you trace him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.01,0:07:59.57,Animal,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.26,0:08:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to take the trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.01,0:08:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can't sense within 500 yards!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.62,0:08:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.33,0:08:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's out of range...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.35,0:08:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would run away within 500 yards?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.51,0:08:11.20,Animal,,0,0,0,,I'll find him...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.87,0:08:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We must hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.37,0:08:18.14,Animal,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.66,0:08:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't summon Xiaolong...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.27,0:08:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you'll see what I can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.28,0:08:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes the king of the jungle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.93,0:08:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.52,0:08:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, we can take our time...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.55,0:08:40.32,Animal,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.61,0:08:41.29,Animal,,0,0,0,,Hei-xiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.12,0:08:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You let loose a bunch of mosquitoes...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.02,0:08:48.57,Animal,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.44,0:08:59.03,Animal,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.12,0:08:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.18,0:09:03.85,Animal,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.74,0:09:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll carry her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.03,0:09:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so light!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.21,0:09:13.88,Animal,,0,0,0,,She was light a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.19,0:09:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems our mass has decreased,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.63,0:09:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,However, it seems our stamina has decreased too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.23,0:09:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We've also gotten a lot smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.90,0:09:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,One mile now feels like 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.30,0:09:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't catch up by ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.95,0:09:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We should get something to ride on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.19,0:09:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.88,0:09:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels even slower...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.12,0:09:48.87,Animal,,0,0,0,,The Heixius left us behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.19,0:09:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope they'll soon find him...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.12,0:09:51.84,Animal,,0,0,0,,Fairies never get tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.33,0:09:53.18,Animal,,0,0,0,,Are you sure he stopped somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.66,0:09:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in a bad condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.94,0:09:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs a place to regenerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.03,0:09:57.79,Animal,,0,0,0,,But no idea how far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.97,0:10:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,A carnivorous squirrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.59,0:10:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We can ride it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.35,0:10:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You just scared it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.27,0:10:07.65,Animal,,0,0,0,,It was so fast! Let's find another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.82,0:10:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.33,0:10:11.07,Animal,,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.79,0:10:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.50,0:10:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.12,0:10:17.90,Animal,,0,0,0,,He'll give us a ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.95,0:10:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.96,0:10:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,At least less tiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.07,0:10:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find something else...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.42,0:10:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.22,0:10:24.94,Animal,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.62,0:10:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.63,0:10:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.04,0:10:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.64,0:10:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A spirit space?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.62,0:11:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,One-way gravity?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.60,0:11:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pooped!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.51,0:11:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't go on anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.64,0:11:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.89,0:11:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't compare a preteen human's flesh-and-blood body to a fairy's.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.24,0:11:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get some food...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.21,0:11:17.05,Animal,,0,0,0,,The Heixius can't find more traces.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.08,0:11:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.97,0:11:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's eat first...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.94,0:11:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaping mushroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.78,0:11:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It gives you a terrible diarrhea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.66,0:11:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Inedible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.89,0:11:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Bud-sucking caterpillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.77,0:11:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nutritious and really tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.25,0:11:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.33,0:11:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Cloud mushroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.11,0:11:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard as steel, used for making tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.45,0:11:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Inedible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.48,0:11:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.17,0:11:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Inedible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.79,0:11:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Inedible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.39,0:11:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.10,0:11:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Inedible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.66,0:11:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.02,0:11:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Exploding chrysanthemum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.11,0:11:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Pollen bursts out of it on touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.77,0:11:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes animals pollinate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.46,0:11:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But its fruit is edible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.49,0:11:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Much faster now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.20,0:12:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.58,0:12:10.30,Animal,,0,0,0,,Hei-xiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.86,0:12:11.60,Animal,,0,0,0,,He left traces everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.63,0:12:12.32,Animal,,0,0,0,,and there was more to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.34,0:12:13.03,Animal,,0,0,0,,But now there's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.57,0:12:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he must be nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.34,0:12:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.51,0:12:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.73,0:12:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel him all around, though weakly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.79,0:12:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have scattered his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.43,0:12:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he roughly?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.81,0:12:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll force him to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.27,0:12:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these the places?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.79,0:12:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I feel him at those places.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.58,0:12:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.89,0:13:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Stronger than I expected...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're strong without being integrated to that body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.37,0:13:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were in your own body,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.87,0:13:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be a match for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.39,0:13:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So you realized it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.98,0:13:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't attack us when we fell in your trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.85,0:13:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think we're enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.68,0:13:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we help you with something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.88,0:13:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.23,0:13:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The tree fairy who you possess,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.93,0:13:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,will die very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.68,0:13:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to give my life up for this fairy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.36,0:13:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.54,0:13:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm offering you a tree type soul core.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.83,0:14:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a tempting offer indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.12,0:14:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But my soul found this body\Nafter three years of wandering.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.60,0:14:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't take risks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.15,0:14:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I guarantee the soul core is just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.11,0:14:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.92,0:14:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I make you trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.56,0:14:16.60,Title 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1600,0)\pos(440,582)}Immortal and Fairy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.99,0:14:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I put my life\Nin the hands of a stranger?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.66,0:14:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.40,0:14:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't persuade him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.62,0:14:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.77,0:14:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.40,0:14:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.50,0:14:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You leave me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.87,0:14:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to kill him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.22,0:14:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange... Where did this attack come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.81,0:14:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you can't scatter\Nnor regenerate your body, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.05,0:14:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.49,0:14:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird question to ask during a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.81,0:14:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just so you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.95,0:14:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,one more hit like that, and you'll meet your end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.22,0:15:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My spirit space!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.45,0:15:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rude to leave like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.53,0:15:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.58,0:15:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You let me into your space too easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.45,0:15:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.16,0:15:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are willing to leave this body now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.38,0:15:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,my offer is still valid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.43,0:15:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.42,0:15:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't force you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.72,0:15:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you up to?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.34,0:15:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The least that I can do,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.02,0:15:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Is send you into the next life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.69,0:15:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're willing to kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.49,0:15:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Technically, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.03,0:15:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't force you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.70,0:15:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The fairy's as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.40,0:15:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you won't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.62,0:15:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you get that assumption?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.86,0:15:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I was only asked for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.74,0:15:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I don't want to lose the soul core.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.50,0:15:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.77,0:15:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,it's just a mere fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.29,0:15:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.06,0:16:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If I die, you'll stay like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.01,0:16:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't lock me up in your spirit space.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.21,0:16:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially once it becomes ownerless after you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.88,0:16:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.87,0:16:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll consider your offer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.54,0:16:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.48,0:16:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.22,0:16:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I accept it! I accept it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.99,0:16:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiguo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.31,0:16:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiguo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.06,0:16:27.55,Animal,,0,0,0,,It's all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.97,0:16:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never thought you'd be able to hide\Nin a plant within such a short time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.19,0:16:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I destroy your new place?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.95,0:16:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Or will you come out on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.65,0:16:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you kill everything around you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.90,0:16:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're being dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.50,0:16:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you please revert the magic first?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.26,0:16:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise I can't summon the soul core.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.27,0:16:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You just killed the tree fairy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.15,0:16:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I believe you have a soul core?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.73,0:16:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, that tree fairy...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.99,0:17:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've saved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.14,0:17:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Fenmo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.43,0:17:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiguo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.38,0:17:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How's this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.21,0:17:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.35,0:17:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's space type...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.35,0:17:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say you made a complete fool out of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.39,0:17:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We had to hurry, please forgive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.32,0:17:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I hadn't left that body even at the risk of death?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.56,0:17:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd be back at square one, wouldn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.08,0:17:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We're back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.28,0:17:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.44,0:17:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You left me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.76,0:17:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A tree type soul core!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.41,0:17:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still willing to give it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.43,0:17:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you afraid it's a fake?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.06,0:17:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't go that far just to destroy a roaming soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.77,0:17:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.78,0:17:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm finally revived!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.44,0:18:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good body indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.56,0:18:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotten much stronger now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.75,0:18:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you not afraid I'll attack you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.11,0:18:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't trust me first,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.73,0:18:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,so I have to trust you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.54,0:18:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.84,0:18:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your name, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.79,0:18:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can call me Gen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.70,0:18:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Muluo, I am an immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.69,0:18:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Muluo...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.49,0:18:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Shame on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.59,0:18:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't toy with our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.69,0:18:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.83,0:18:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I am ashamed of myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.51,0:18:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I take whatever punishment you see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.24,0:18:32.90,Animal,,0,0,0,,What will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.66,0:18:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.70,0:18:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you have done?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.93,0:18:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have sacrificed Qiguo to save myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.55,0:18:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.01,0:18:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if it wasn't Qiguo,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.02,0:18:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,but those two ladybugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.67,0:18:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.10,0:18:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you say such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.14,0:18:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't be compared...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.81,0:19:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with ladybugs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.26,0:19:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.63,0:19:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'd have done the same...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.42,0:19:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you wouldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.42,0:19:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no right to condemn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.33,0:19:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to make up for it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.85,0:19:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,ask Qiguo when he wakes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.28,0:19:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.80,0:19:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's best this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.31,0:19:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I leave things here to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.38,0:19:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Must you leave so soon, Gen?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.09,0:19:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This mudball is my soul stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.12,0:19:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's worth far less than the soul core.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.21,0:19:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But my spirit space abilities are in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.25,0:19:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ever need my help, you can call me with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.27,0:19:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll gladly accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.87,0:19:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We're leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.97,0:19:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I will take care of the two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.30,0:19:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Gen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.69,0:19:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll visit you when Qiguo's recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.65,0:19:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We can go back too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.57,0:19:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.54,0:19:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you not angry with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.87,0:19:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.31,0:19:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a lovely little fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.27,0:20:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to be my disciple?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.21,0:20:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.14,0:20:08.26,Animal,,0,0,0,,Can we leave the fairies to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, Muluo is a high-ranking immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:13.34,Animal,,0,0,0,,What if it's not really him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.09,0:20:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.78,0:20:17.46,Animal,,0,0,0,,Was he in the wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.07,0:20:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not so easy to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.94,0:20:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,An immortal and a fairy...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.37,0:20:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a human being and a sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.23,0:20:26.37,Animal,,0,0,0,,So a sparrow's life's worth nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.45,0:20:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.70,0:20:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The immortal can be the sparrow, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.69,0:20:32.35,Animal,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.30,0:20:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Prolongation of life always requires sacrifices.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.33,0:20:37.23,Animal,,0,0,0,,So you don't want to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.61,0:20:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cherish life even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.28,0:21:32.66,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Stay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.28,0:21:32.66,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.66,0:21:37.40,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Our destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.66,0:21:37.40,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.40,0:21:42.10,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.40,0:21:42.10,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.10,0:21:48.30,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,I’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.10,0:21:48.30,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,kore kara deau kimi e to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.30,0:21:54.45,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Wait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.30,0:21:54.45,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.45,0:21:59.25,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Even if our first “hello” is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.45,0:21:59.25,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.25,0:22:03.93,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,When we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.25,0:22:03.93,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.93,0:22:10.45,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Let’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.93,0:22:10.45,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.45,0:22:21.77,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,The days when we can casually say “See you tomorrow”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.45,0:22:21.77,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.77,0:22:27.19,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Are so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.77,0:22:27.19,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.19,0:22:32.23,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Those feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.19,0:22:32.23,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.23,0:22:43.46,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,We can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.23,0:22:43.46,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.46,0:22:49.01,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.46,0:22:49.01,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.01,0:22:55.85,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,And surely, they’re calling out to me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.01,0:22:55.85,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu
